t a year now. There sushi is delicious and perfect presentation. I love there ramen too (specially the spicy one). It comes In a giant bowl so you will never leave feeling not satisfied and full. I also get there beef fried rice and it's also great bang for your buck too. They also have a online ordering option so if you don't feel like ordering through server then you can use the app. Seem to also try to space people out for social distancing. Would definitely come again for date night or just if I get a craving for some ramen."},{"business_id":"I-23nT_0H9lEW8qFHLQ1pA","review_id":"N8olIjtkVKo3ure-9j0kgQ","date":"2020-08-11T07:03:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9401624202728271,"text_excerpt":"My friend and I decided on a sushi spot one night as a place to catch up and ended up here. Parking sucks in the area but once you find a spot after making several blocks you're good to go. Lol We walked in and were immediately seated. The atmosphere is nice with the dimly lit dining room. Bare with me, I'm trying to create a scene for you. Lol It didn't take very long for us to be greeted by our waitress, she was pleasant. I'm a dumpling lover so I ordered their dumplings for an appetizer...they were decent...I'll had better but that's just me. They were still pretty good. On to entrees. We both ordered different rolls for me...the spicy crawfish roll...the presentation was great and it ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"I-23nT_0H9lEW8qFHLQ1pA","photo_id":"nTqzz8VWPCM6UnpUP9aXsQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nTqzz8VWPCM6UnpUP9aXsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9071109890937805},{"business_id":"I-23nT_0H9lEW8qFHLQ1pA","photo_id":"FazwO7gr2a2vWXcdEVJ0JQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FazwO7gr2a2vWXcdEVJ0JQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.849722683429718},{"business_id":"I-23nT_0H9lEW8qFHLQ1pA","photo_id":"YyLdHDpmD-GXLdnCqt5TgA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/YyLdHDpmD-GXLdnCqt5TgA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8403007388114929},{"bu